\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[TD 控制算法] --&gt; B[Q-learning]&#10;    A --&gt; C[SARSA]&#10;    B --&gt; D[离策略]&#10;    B --&gt; E[max Q 作为目标]&#10;    C --&gt; F[在策略]&#10;    C --&gt; G[实际动作 Q 作为目标]&#10;    D --&gt; H[学习最优策略]&#10;    F --&gt; I[学习当前策略的值]\">graph TD\n    A[TD 控制算法] --&gt; B[Q-learning]\n    A --&gt; C[SARSA]\n    B --&gt; D[离策略]\n    B --&gt; E[max Q 作为目标]\n    C --&gt; F[在策略]\n    C --&gt; G[实际动作 Q 作为目标]\n    D --&gt; H[学习最优策略]\n    F --&gt; I[学习当前策略的值]</pre><p>两种算法的核心对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Q-learning</th>\n<th>SARSA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>策略类型</td>\n<td>离策略</td>\n<td>在策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TD 目标</td>\n<td>max_a Q(s&#39;,a)</td>\n<td>Q(s&#39;,a&#39;)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收敛目标</td>\n<td>Q* (最优)</td>\n<td>Q^π (当前策略)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为策略</td>\n<td>任意（需覆盖）</td>\n<td>当前策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>可能学到冒险策略</td>\n<td>倾向安全策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收敛条件</td>\n<td>所有 (s,a) 被无限访问</td>\n<td>策略 GLIE</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"q-learning-算法详解\">Q-learning 算法详解</h2><p>Q-learning 由 Watkins 于 1989 年提出，是强化学习历史上最重要的算法之一。它的核心洞见是：更新目标使用 max<em>a Q(s</em>{t+1},a) 而非实际执行动作的 Q 值，使得学习过程独立于行为策略——无论智能体实际执行什么动作（包括随机探索动作），Q-learning 都在学习最优策略。</p>\n<p>Q-learning 的完整算法流程是：初始化 Q 表，在每个时间步观察状态 s<em>t，按行为策略（通常是 ε-贪心）选择动作 a_t，执行后获得 r</em>{t+1} 和 s*{t+1}，然后用 r*{t+1} + γ·max<em>a Q(s</em>{t+1},a) 作为目标更新 Q(s_t,a_t)。</p>\n<p>Q-learning 的收敛性定理指出：在表格情况下，如果所有状态-动作对被无限频繁地访问，且学习率满足 Robbins-Monro 条件（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_t \\alpha_t = \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></msub><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_t \\alpha_t^2 \\lt \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1138em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>），Q-learning 保证以概率 1 收敛到最优动作价值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>Q-learning 的一个重要问题是<strong>最大化偏差（Maximization Bias）</strong>。由于更新目标中使用 max 操作，当 Q 估计存在噪声时，max 运算会系统性地高估价值——因为它总是选择噪声恰好为正的那个动作的估计值。这种偏差在早期学习阶段（Q 估计不准确时）特别严重。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Q-learning] --&gt; B[最大化偏差问题]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Double Q-learning]&#10;    C --&gt; D[两组 Q 表]&#10;    D --&gt; E[交替更新]&#10;    E --&gt; F[解耦选择与评估]&#10;    subgraph 解决方案&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;        F&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[Q-learning] --&gt; B[最大化偏差问题]\n    B --&gt; C[Double Q-learning]\n    C --&gt; D[两组 Q 表]\n    D --&gt; E[交替更新]\n    E --&gt; F[解耦选择与评估]\n    subgraph 解决方案\n        C\n        D\n        E\n        F\n    end</pre><p><strong>Double Q-learning</strong> 通过维护两组 Q 值来解决最大化偏差。每次更新时随机选择一组来确定最优动作（选择），用另一组来评估该动作的值（评估）。这种解耦消除了系统性的高估偏差，在实践中显著提升了学习质量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sarsa-算法详解\">SARSA 算法详解</h2><p>SARSA 的名称来源于其更新所需的五元组 (S<em>t, A_t, R</em>{t+1}, S*{t+1}, A*{t+1})。与 Q-learning 不同，SARSA 使用实际在 s*{t+1} 执行的动作 a*{t+1} 的 Q 值作为更新目标，因此它学习的是当前策略（包括探索动作）的动作价值函数。</p>\n<p>这一差异在有风险的环境中尤为显著。考虑一个悬崖行走（Cliff Walking）问题：沿悬崖边走是最短路径但有掉落风险（ε 概率随机动作可能导致坠崖）。Q-learning 会学到沿悬崖边走的最优路径（因为它在学最优策略的值），但在 ε-贪心执行时偶尔坠崖，实际累积奖励反而较低。SARSA 则会学到远离悬崖的安全路径（因为它在学包含 ε 探索的当前策略的值），虽然路径更长但实际累积奖励更高。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>Q-learning 行为</th>\n<th>SARSA 行为</th>\n<th>实际效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>安全环境</td>\n<td>最优路径</td>\n<td>次优但安全</td>\n<td>Q-learning 更优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高风险环境</td>\n<td>最优但高风险</td>\n<td>安全路径</td>\n<td>SARSA 更优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ε→0 时</td>\n<td>最优策略</td>\n<td>也趋向最优</td>\n<td>两者等价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>SARSA 的收敛条件是策略必须满足 GLIE（Greedy in the Limit with Infinite Exploration）：所有状态-动作对被无限探索，且策略在极限下收敛到贪心策略。常用的 ε-递减策略满足这一条件。</p>\n<p><strong>Expected SARSA</strong> 是 SARSA 的改进版本，用期望值代替采样值：更新目标变为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_a \\pi(a \\mid s_{t+1})\\, Q(s_{t+1}, a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这消除了采样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 带来的额外方差，同时保持在策略学习的特性。当目标策略是贪心策略时，Expected SARSA 退化为 Q-learning，因此 Expected SARSA 可以看作 Q-learning 和 SARSA 的统一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表格方法的局限与扩展\">表格方法的局限与扩展</h2><p>表格形式的 Q-learning 和 SARSA 要求为每个状态-动作对维护独立的 Q 值条目。当状态空间和动作空间较大时，这种方式面临严重的存储和效率问题。</p>\n<p><strong>状态空间爆炸</strong>：围棋有约 10^{170} 个合法状态，Atari 游戏的像素输入对应天文数字级别的状态空间。表格方法无法处理如此庞大的状态空间，更无法在合理时间内对每个状态-动作对进行充分的采样。</p>\n<p><strong>缺乏泛化能力</strong>：表格方法将每个状态完全独立对待，在一个状态上的学习经验无法迁移到相似状态。即使两个状态只有微小差异，它们的 Q 值估计也是完全独立的。</p>\n<p><strong>连续空间问题</strong>：许多实际问题的状态空间和/或动作空间是连续的（如机器人关节角度），表格方法完全无法处理。</p>\n<p>这些局限催生了两个重要方向：<strong>线性函数近似</strong>用特征向量的线性组合来近似 Q 函数，Q(s,a) ≈ w^T·φ(s,a)，具有理论收敛保证但表达能力有限；**深度 Q 网络（DQN）**用深度神经网络近似 Q 函数，表达能力强大但失去了收敛保证。DQN 的成功开启了深度强化学习时代，将在后续章节详细讨论。</p>\n<p>从表格方法到函数近似的跨越不仅是实现技术的变化，更带来了根本性的理论挑战。表格方法中的很多收敛保证在函数近似下不再成立，需要新的理论工具和实践技巧来确保学习的稳定性和有效性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Q-learning 与 SARSA))&#10;    Q-learning&#10;      离策略&#10;      最大化偏差&#10;      Double Q-learning&#10;    SARSA&#10;      在策略&#10;      安全策略&#10;      Expected SARSA&#10;    统一视角&#10;      GPI 实例&#10;      TD 控制&#10;      策略-值交互&#10;    扩展方向&#10;      函数近似&#10;      DQN&#10;      连续空间\">mindmap\n  root((Q-learning 与 SARSA))\n    Q-learning\n      离策略\n      最大化偏差\n      Double Q-learning\n    SARSA\n      在策略\n      安全策略\n      Expected SARSA\n    统一视角\n      GPI 实例\n      TD 控制\n      策略-值交互\n    扩展方向\n      函数近似\n      DQN\n      连续空间</pre><ul>\n<li>Q-learning 是离策略 TD 控制算法，使用 max Q 作为更新目标，直接逼近最优策略</li>\n<li>SARSA 是在策略 TD 控制算法，使用实际下一步动作的 Q 值更新，倾向学习安全策略</li>\n<li>Q-learning 存在最大化偏差问题，Double Q-learning 通过解耦选择和评估来缓解</li>\n<li>Expected SARSA 统一了 Q-learning 和 SARSA，用期望代替采样降低方差</li>\n<li>表格方法受限于状态空间大小和缺乏泛化能力，推动了函数近似方法的发展</li>\n<li>从表格到函数近似是深度强化学习的关键跨越，带来新的理论和实践挑战</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Q-learning 与 SARSA","id":"q-learning-与-sarsa"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Q-learning 算法详解","id":"q-learning-算法详解"},{"level":2,"text":"SARSA 算法详解","id":"sarsa-算法详解"},{"level":2,"text":"表格方法的局限与扩展","id":"表格方法的局限与扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时序差分学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/value-based-methods/temporal-difference"},"next":{"title":"策略梯度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/policy-gradient"}}